              "settings": {
                "text": "<h2>Hello. We're Combustion Inc.</h2><p>We build nice things that make cooking more enjoyable.</p><p>You don't need much to prepare a great meal. A sharp knife, a few good pans, and a modest assortment of other tools are enough. You should definitely have a good thermometer.&nbsp;</p><p>We made ours wireless and stuffed it with 8 temperature sensors. It works with our big and bold Kitchen Display and our iOS and Android apps. They’re all extremely easy to use.</p><p>Oh, and did we mention that our thermometer can <em>predict the future?</em> Let us explain…</p>",
